msgid "One-time Excel preparations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../udfs.md:13
msgid ""
"Enable `Trust access to the VBA project object model` under `File > Options "
"> Trust Center > Trust Center Settings > Macro Settings`. You only need to "
"do this once. Also, this is only required for importing the functions, i.e. "
"end users won't need to bother about this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../udfs.md:15
msgid ""
"Install the add-in via command prompt: `xlwings addin install` (see [Add-in "
