msgid "Expanding array formulas will overwrite cells without prompting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../udfs.md:342
msgid ""
"Pre v0.15.0 doesn't allow to have volatile functions as arguments, e.g. you "
"cannot use functions like `=TODAY()` as arguments. Starting with v0.15.0, "
"you can use volatile functions as input, but the UDF will be called more "
"than 1x."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../udfs.md:344
msgid ""
"Dynamic Arrays have been refactored with v0.15.0 to be proper legacy arrays: "
"To edit a dynamic array with xlwings >= v0.15.0, you need to hit `Ctrl-Shift-"
"Enter` while in the top left cell. Note that you don't have to do that when "
"you enter the formula for the first time."
msgstr ""

